RetinexDual  (https://github.com/ErrorLogic1211/RetinexDual)
Copyright 2025-2026 Mohab Kishawy, Ali Abdellatif Hussein, Jun Chen
Apache License 2.0

  The work this repository reproduces. Its code and weights are downloaded at
  run time and are neither vendored nor redistributed here.

  Two short functions in scripts/ are reimplementations of behaviour in that
  repository, written so this report can measure it:

    check_image_size   reflect-padding to a multiple of 128, matching
                       inference_RetinexDual.py, so the input geometry is
                       identical to the released path
    ssim_matlab        the MATLAB-style SSIM estimator in its utils.py, an
                       11x11 Gaussian with sigma 1.5 and [0,255] constants

