BasicSR  (https://github.com/XPixelGroup/BasicSR)
Copyright 2018-2022 BasicSR Authors
Apache License 2.0

  RetinexDual's basicsr/ package derives from BasicSR, and this repository calls
  into it (img2tensor, tensor2img) rather than reimplementing it. The bgr2y
  function in scripts/ssim_protocol_probe.py reproduces the BT.601 luma
